        "title": "Expanded DEFAULTIGNOREDFILES in constants.ts",
        "summary": "Added .env.*, .DS_Store, .pytest_cache, .mypy_cache, .ruff_cache, and .next to DEFAULT_IGNORED_FILES in common/src/constants.ts. Reordered existing env and ENV entries. Prevents Freebuff from indexing generated caches, OS metadata, and Next.js build outputs.",
