      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant now skips a few extra types of files that are normally hidden, auto-generated, or only useful while a project is being built, like local environment settings, OS metadata, and temporary test caches. You would notice this only if you browse your project's file list and see these previously indexed items now appear empty to the assistant. It applies to anyone whose project contains these files.",
